# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Application workspace state (Freebuff client) — not project content
.freebuff/

# Generated AF3 job files / export trees (regenerate with `configbuilder`)
# — root-anchored so it never matches the configbuilder/output source package
/output/

# Internal working copies (.cbproj autosave) — the application's resume state
.configbuilder/

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large local reference data — kept out of the repository on purpose.
#
# `testdata/` holds two multi-megabyte MSA JSON dumps (23.4 MB and 12.0 MB).
# No test, fixture or runtime module reads them: they are reference examples of
# the protein/RNA/ligand MSA shapes, recorded in HANDOFF.md as "referenced by
# no current test". They stay on disk and out of Git so a clone stays small.
# Root-anchored: nothing under tests/fixtures/ is affected by this rule.
/testdata/

# The five planning/specification documents below describe how the project was
# built rather than what it ships, and `configbuilder/` already carries the
# traceability they provide (rule `spec_ref`s, `MAP-###` cross-references, plan
# section citations). They remain on disk and untracked by decision, not by
# accident. They used to be excluded by a broad `docs/` rule that also excluded
# the two documents the code and tests *do* cite — see the note below.
IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
AUTHORITATIVE_SPEC.md
DOMAIN_MAPPING.md
HANDOFF.md
CHECKLIST.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Version-controlled project material (deliberately NOT ignored).
#
# `tests/`, `fixtures/` and `docs/` were excluded wholesale by earlier rules,
# which left the 896-test suite, its fixtures and the contract-pin document
# untracked: `git ls-files tests` returned 0 files, so no clone could reproduce
# the audit's "895 passed, 1 skipped". They are tracked now.
#
#   tests/     the suite, including tests/fixtures/af3_pipeline/ (checked in)
#   fixtures/  golden recipes, compatibility .cbproj files, fixture builder
#   docs/      CONTRACT_PIN.md (cited by tests) and PROJECT_AUDIT.md
#
# `__pycache__/` above still excludes compiled test bytecode.
